mygo: the notification status

An app could not tell whether the user allows its notifications, to say
so in its settings and offer System Settings.

App.NotificationStatus(fn) tells fn, on the main thread, whether the user
has answered, allows or denies the app's notifications and their style
(none, banner, alert): getNotificationSettingsWithCompletionHandler: on
macOS; a platform that cannot tell answers a status that is not Known.
The fake backend reports its Status.

Test: TestNotificationStatus.

